    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wummsen Village is a up to <strong>4 players Party Brawler</strong>, that creates a new experience by taking away from standard fighting mechanics. With a <strong>simpler input scheme</strong> we want to reduce the entry time for beginners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE BUTTON - CRAZY COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks follow a Revolver System. Pressing the attack button three times in a row, will also launch three different attacks towards your opponent. This makes it simple for beginners as you can get used to the controls quickly. Realy pros learn to use the revolver cycle in there gameplay smoothly and therefore dish out loads of damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.poster.avif?t=1755499933\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.webm?t=1755499933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.mp4?t=1755499933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBO KINGDOM - THE FIGHTING MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting your opponent will <strong>send them flying!</strong> While airborn that can't fight back, so let them feel <strong>what 8X stands for.</strong><br>You are not alone while pummeling your opponent. <strong>The barriers aswell as some stages will join the fight!</strong> Only watch out to not get hit by the stage combo yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/e13caf636352d887443fea4252149261.avif?t=1755499933\" width=720 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wummsen Village is a up to <strong>4 players Party Brawler</strong>, that creates a new experience by taking away from standard fighting mechanics. With a <strong>simpler input scheme</strong> we want to reduce the entry time for beginners.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE BUTTON - CRAZY COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks follow a Revolver System. Pressing the attack button three times in a row, will also launch three different attacks towards your opponent. This makes it simple for beginners as you can get used to the controls quickly. Realy pros learn to use the revolver cycle in there gameplay smoothly and therefore dish out loads of damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.poster.avif?t=1755499933\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.webm?t=1755499933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/c5e9ca9c043a77d59be96fbccd3105e6.mp4?t=1755499933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBO KINGDOM - THE FIGHTING MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting your opponent will <strong>send them flying!</strong> While airborn that can't fight back, so let them feel <strong>what 8X stands for.</strong><br>You are not alone while pummeling your opponent. <strong>The barriers aswell as some stages will join the fight!</strong> Only watch out to not get hit by the stage combo yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142230/extras/e13caf636352d887443fea4252149261.avif?t=1755499933\" width=720 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
